For that problem class we have: $L_{+,w} \ge \left(\frac{1}{n} \sum_{i=1}^n \frac{1}{n w_i} 4\| ({a_i} {a_i}^\top) \cdot ({a_i} {a_i}^\top)\| + 2\lambda^2 {L_r}^2\right)^{1/2}$

