\section{Experiments}\label{sec:experiments}

We compare \algname{Freya PAGE} with \algname{Rennala SGD}, \algname{Asynchronous SGD}, and \algname{Soviet PAGE} on nonconvex quadratic optimization tasks and practical machine learning problems. The experiments were conducted in Python 3.8 with Intel(R) Xeon(R) Gold 6248 CPU @ 2.50GHz.
We developed a library that emulates the working behavior of thousands of nodes.


